  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "とんでもない女優だ  (An Unprecedented Debut Performance)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "kuroki": "黒木",
    "kawada": "川田"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Once cameras roll, Kaoru Kuroki sheds every trace of hesitation and takes complete command of the scene, pushing Muranishi to his absolute physical limit while the conch whistle echoes across the studio. Listen to Muranishi, Kuroki, and Kawada in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どんどん出してください、自分を出してください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "笛がないわ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "もう、私の好きにさせて！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "まるでエスエムみたいだ。もうもたない…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "まだダメ…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "お疲れさま。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "いや、あえて編集しない。もう全部使う。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "とんでもない女優だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうにか撮れてよかった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ウソだろ？まだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "体に毒だ、せめて三本にしなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "バケモンだ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どんどん出してください、自分を出してください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let everything out — bring your true self right to the surface!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "笛がないわ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait — I lost the whistle!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "もう、私の好きにさせて！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Enough — let me do this my own way!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "まるでエスエムみたいだ。もうもたない…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This feels practically like dominance play — I can't hold out much longer...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "まだダメ…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not yet — don't stop yet...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "お疲れさま。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Incredible work today, everyone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "いや、あえて編集しない。もう全部使う。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No — we purposely won't edit this down; we're using the entire take.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "とんでもない女優だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She is an unbelievable force of an actress.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうにか撮れてよかった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm just grateful we managed to capture it on tape.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ウソだろ？まだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You've got to be kidding — she's still going?!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "体に毒だ、せめて三本にしなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You'll hurt yourself at that rate — keep it to three at most!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "バケモンだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She is a force of nature.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
